title: Run the opposition operation
subtitle: Turn the chosen 2023 mandate into a bill, hearing or field campaign. Three-month cooldown.
face-image: img/poland/cards/negotiate-government.webp
card-image: img/poland/cards/negotiate-government.webp
new-page: true
is-card: true
frequency: 140
tags: poland_negotiation_card
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and opposition_2023_mandate_set = 1 and time >= opposition_operation_last_time + 3

= [+ opposition_2023_strategy +]

The cabinet owns implementation and the treasury. Lewica owns a parliamentary
club, party resources and whatever public case it can document. Choose one
operation; none of them quietly spends government money.

- @shadow_bill
- @committee_hearing
- @field_campaign

@shadow_bill
title: File a costed shadow bill
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Converts a promise into text and a recorded government refusal.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The policy desk needs one party resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.opposition_operation_last_time = Q.time;
Q.negotiation_capital += Q.opposition_2023_strategy_code == "social" ? 4 : 3;
Q.issue_ownership += 2;
Q.media_capacity += 1;
Q.labor_credibility += Q.opposition_2023_strategy_code == "social" ? 2 : 0;
Q.last_policy_stage = "Costed opposition bill";
Q.last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition";
Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica files a costed bill the cabinet must answer";
!}
go-to: poland_card_finish

@committee_hearing
title: Open a delivery hearing
subtitle: Free. Produces scrutiny and leverage, but no enacted programme.
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.opposition_operation_last_time = Q.time;
Q.negotiation_capital += Q.opposition_2023_strategy_code == "watchdog" ? 4 : 2;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 2;
Q.media_capacity += Q.opposition_2023_strategy_code == "watchdog" ? 2 : 1;
Q.government_delivery -= 1;
Q.last_policy_stage = "Committee scrutiny";
Q.last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition";
Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
Q.news_headline = "A Lewica hearing puts the cabinet's delivery record on file";
!}
go-to: poland_card_finish

@field_campaign
title: Take the mandate into constituencies
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Builds organisers instead of bargaining for an office.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The field operation needs one party resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.opposition_operation_last_time = Q.time;
Q.local_network += 3;
Q.workers_support += Q.opposition_2023_strategy_code == "social" ? 3 : 1;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.negotiation_capital += Q.opposition_2023_strategy_code == "broker" ? 3 : 1;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica turns its opposition mandate into a constituency campaign";
!}
go-to: poland_card_finish
